1
00:00:00,687 --> 00:00:03,247
(Arthur:)I can't catch a break today.

2
00:00:03,923 --> 00:00:06,253
(Penny:)We'll pack up your stuff,
meet you at the hospital.

3
00:00:06,459 --> 00:00:08,159
(Leonard:)Sorry things turned out this way.

4
00:00:08,361 --> 00:00:14,131
Well, at this point, I'm just glad
someone's carrying me down the stairs.

5
00:00:18,405 --> 00:00:22,035
(Sheldon:)Met my childhood hero,
now I get to ride in an ambulance.

6
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:25,838
(Sheldon:)Boy, if we can get him to do that calendar,
this will be the best day ever.

7
00:00:29,382 --> 00:00:31,042
I can't believe we lost her.

8
00:00:31,284 --> 00:00:34,084
(Bernadette:)What was I thinking? I'd be a terrible mom.

9
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,790
(Howard:)Maybe with the first one.

10
00:00:35,989 --> 00:00:39,389
(Howard:)But kids are like pancakes,
the first one's always a throwaway.

11
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,390
(Howard:)- How's this look?
- It's fine.

12
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:50,769
(Bernadette:)- Where'd you get that picture of her?
- It's not her. I Googled "foo-foo little dogs."

13
00:00:52,572 --> 00:00:55,512
(Howard:)It's Raj. Stay quiet.

14
00:00:56,576 --> 00:01:01,026
Hey, heh, bad timing. Bernadette just took
Cinnamon out for a walk.

